give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"A Misleading Outcome\"", "italic": true, "color": "green"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Chef", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many pairs of evil players there are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Preacher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: a Minion, if chosen, learns this. All chosen Minions have no ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Town Crier", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn if a Minion nominated today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Innkeeper", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose 2 players: they can't die tonight, but 1 is drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gambler", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player & guess their character: if you guess wrong, you die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lycanthrope", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose an alive player. If good, they die & the Demon doesn't kill tonight. One good player registers as evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Artist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, privately ask the Storyteller any yes/no question."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Magician", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Demon thinks you are a Minion. Minions think you are a Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poppy Grower", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nMinions & Demons do not know each other. If you die, they learn who each other are that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Atheist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Storyteller can break the game rules, and if executed, good wins, even if you are dead. [No evil characters]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hermit", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have all Outsider abilities. [-0 or -1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hatter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Minion & Demon players may choose new Minion & Demon characters to be."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poisoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned tonight and tomorrow day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Psychopath", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach day, before nominations, you may publicly choose a player: they die. If executed, you only die if you lose roshambo."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Summoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou get 3 bluffs. On the 3rd night, choose a player: they become an evil Demon of your choice. [No Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mastermind", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf the Demon dies by execution (ending the game), play for 1 more day. If a player is then executed, their team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Baron", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThere are extra Outsiders in play. [+2 Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lil' Monsta", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, Minions choose who babysits Lil' Monsta & \"is the Demon\". Each night*, a player might die. [+1 Minion]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zombuul", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, if no-one died today, choose a player: they die. The 1st time you die, you live but register as dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Riot", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nOn day 3, Minions become Riot & nominees die but nominate an alive player immediately. This must happen."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barista", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night, until dusk, 1) a player becomes sober, healthy & gets true info, or 2) their ability works twice. They learn which."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cacklejack", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach day, choose a player: a different player changes character tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bone Collector", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnce per game, at night*, choose a dead player: they regain their ability until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scapegoat", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nIf a player of your alignment is executed, you might be executed instead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gnome", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nAll players start knowing a player of your alignment. You may choose to kill anyone who nominates them."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"]],title:"A Misleading Outcome Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "A Misleading Outcome Script", "italic": false, "color": "green", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"A Misleading Outcome\"", "italic": false, "color": "green"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]